    "title": "Shreveport Man Arrested for Domestic Shooting at a Juvenile - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Shreveport\nShreveport Man Arrested for Domestic Shooting at a Juvenile\nBy Rueben Wright,\n4 hours agoOn Monday, Shreveport Police were able to make an arrest following a violent domestic incident. Officers responded to reports of a 15 year-old who had been assaulted by her boyfriend. The victim was treated at a local hospital, where she told investigators about a months-long sexual relationship with the suspect 20 year-old Nicholas Mims. According to the victim, the assault happened after a heated argument. The fight escalated when Mims allegedly punched her, pulled her hair, and fired multiple shots at her with a .22 caliber rifle.",
